      <activity id="a0759209-01ca-5bc7-9dc3-d15ff1094743" activityNameId="7702a546-396a-56eb-80ad-bf483746a7d2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Inverter, 500kW, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Inverter, 500kW, at plant
Production of an inverter (500kW) with an efficiency of 95.4% (total efficiency factor which includes MPP-Tracking) for photovoltaic plant. Total weight about 3000 kg.;
Synonyms: inverse rectifier; 
UUID: c775edcd-8f2c-39ec-a81c-40a0463fe041
Materials, packaging and electricity use for the production of an inverse rectifier. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: Production in RER.
Technology: Inverter for a photovoltaic grid-connected system with a capacity of 500kWp.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c775edcd-8f2c-39ec-a81c-40a0463fe041.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
